{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raveren: The Legend of Etheria</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark fantasy RPG where memory is your greatest weapon\u2014and your deepest curse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, the world of Etheria was torn apart by <i>The Sundering</i>, a failed magical ritual that unleashed <i>Raveren</i>\u2014a cosmic entity of entropy that devours reality itself. Now, the land is fractured, corrupted by the <i>Aether-Rot</i>: a creeping decay that erodes stone, warps life, and steals memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Kaelen</strong> (or <strong>Lyra</strong>), a lone wanderer gifted with <i>Aether-Sense</i>\u2014an uncanny ability to perceive magic and its corruption. While others forget, you remember everything. Haunted by loss and driven by a need for truth, you uncover a forgotten <i>Memory-Core Shard</i> deep beneath the ruins of the Sunken Spires. What you learn could unravel the world\u2014or save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a shattered realm where factions clash over survival and ideology:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Ironhold</strong>: Militaristic survivors who reject magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Whisperwood Enclaves</strong>: Druids fighting to heal the land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Scholars of Dust</strong>: Mages chasing forbidden knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded6 <strong>Nomadic Tribes</strong>: Scavengers living on the edge of madness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the lost language of <i>Proto-Arcana</i>, uncover ancient truths, and shape the fate of Elteria. But beware\u2014Raveren is still feeding, and your memories may be the final course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Narrative-driven exploration with memory-based mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded Dynamic Aether-Sense gameplay: detect corruption, uncover secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Faction-based choices and branching storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f Atmospheric environments warped by the Aether-Rot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Discover and wield Proto-Arcana to reshape realit</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807610?t=1768932884","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807610?t=1768932884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807610/fa6c5d033fc56766c2c5c3822cf2b3a65acee75a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768932884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807610/fa6c5d033fc56766c2c5c3822cf2b3a65acee75a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768932884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raveren: The Legend of Etheria</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark fantasy RPG where memory is your greatest weapon\u2014and your deepest curse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, the world of Etheria was torn apart by <i>The Sundering</i>, a failed magical ritual that unleashed <i>Raveren</i>\u2014a cosmic entity of entropy that devours reality itself. Now, the land is fractured, corrupted by the <i>Aether-Rot</i>: a creeping decay that erodes stone, warps life, and steals memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Kaelen</strong> (or <strong>Lyra</strong>), a lone wanderer gifted with <i>Aether-Sense</i>\u2014an uncanny ability to perceive magic and its corruption. While others forget, you remember everything. Haunted by loss and driven by a need for truth, you uncover a forgotten <i>Memory-Core Shard</i> deep beneath the ruins of the Sunken Spires. What you learn could unravel the world\u2014or save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a shattered realm where factions clash over survival and ideology:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Ironhold</strong>: Militaristic survivors who reject magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Whisperwood Enclaves</strong>: Druids fighting to heal the land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Scholars of Dust</strong>: Mages chasing forbidden knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded6 <strong>Nomadic Tribes</strong>: Scavengers living on the edge of madness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the lost language of <i>Proto-Arcana</i>, uncover ancient truths, and shape the fate of Elteria. But beware\u2014Raveren is still feeding, and your memories may be the final course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Narrative-driven exploration with memory-based mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded Dynamic Aether-Sense gameplay: detect corruption, uncover secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Faction-based choices and branching storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f Atmospheric environments warped by the Aether-Rot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Discover and wield Proto-Arcana to reshape realit</p></li></ul>","developers":["PixelPunk Studios","O